{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42546","headline":"永嘉乱衣冠南度流落南泉作忆昔吟 · 詹琲","name":"永嘉乱衣冠南度流落南泉作忆昔吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔永嘉际，中原板荡年。\n衣冠坠涂炭，舆辂染腥膻。\n国势多危厄，宗人苦播迁。\n南来频洒泪，渴骥每思泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹琲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}